{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act53side", "eventName": "直到大地变成一颗酸橙", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TO-9", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "绘我们的黎明", "storyInfo": "冲出巨大的沙暴，女孩们终于来到了她们的目的地，旅途的终点——南境。不过......在沙暴里叽叽乱叫的，好像是跟随了她们一路的有袋鼷兽“一撮毛”？", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "image", "attributes": {"image": "cg_letter", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_paper2"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "text": "\\n信写到这里，感觉也应该要结束了。好像一直是我自己在说些不着边际的话......真的非常抱歉。", "multi": "true", "x": 200.0, "y": 260.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "text": "\\n我希望这封信能顺利寄到你手里，但好像又希望......这封信就这样消失在信使和信使的传递之中，不要被任何人看见。", "x": 300.0, "y": 300.0, "alignment": "left", "multi": "true", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "text": "\\n但我还是决定把它寄出去，寄给你。希望你能收到这封信，这至少说明你一切都好。", "multi": "true", "x": 200.0, "y": 260.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "text": "\\n祝你一切顺利。", "x": 300.0, "y": 300.0, "alignment": "left", "multi": "true", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 900.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "text": "爱你的安洁莉娜", "x": 450.0, "y": 500.0, "alignment": "right", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 600.0, "multi": "true", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_sand02", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sandstorm", "loop": "true", "channel": "f", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "76_i11", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.3, "yScale": 1.3, "x": 100.0, "y": 30.0}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xTo": 0.0, "yTo": 0.0, "duration": 60.0, "block": "false", "xScaleFrom": 1.3, "yScaleFrom": 1.3, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.3, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$sjoyasorrow_intro", "key": "$sjoyasorrow_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼叫大铁屯塔台，呼叫大铁屯塔台！这里是安洁莉娜！请确认我和大铁屯的相对位置！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_signlntrfrnc", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这里是塔台，你们正在持续往东南方向移动，目前正处于沙暴区边缘，和大铁屯的相对位置是——滋滋......", "name": "塔台"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "信号越来越不稳定了......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔台，再确认一次，我们现在和大铁屯距离多远？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁——滋滋......距离大铁屯二十公里！你们面前沙暴......滋滋......七公里左右！只是预估数据，沙暴范围随时可能变动......", "name": "塔台"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔台——", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_signlntrfrnc", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......滋滋......滋滋......", "name": "塔台"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......通过！快速通过！源石浓度正在上升——滋滋——活性源石潮从东偏南方向——滋滋——", "name": "塔台"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "活性源石潮？！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔台，请求确认活性源石潮到达时间！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "请求确认活性源石潮到达时间！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$transmission", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔台的连接断了？！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "糟糕......再稳定的系统也禁不起活性源石潮的干扰啊！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......阿梅利亚，麻烦看看车上的源石浓度检测系统！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......按雷姆必拓标准，比安全阈值低四分之一左右！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也就是说已经超过罗德岛的安全标准了！各位——", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——安洁，不许搞征求意见那一套！没人想走回头路！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我有说过要走回头路吗？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我是说，请各位做好防护准备，我要加速了！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮，竖起耳朵，不要放过任何可疑的声音！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "交给我！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿梅利亚，虽然有点可惜，麻烦你再放飞两只“小飞虫”，随时报告周围的异常情况！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好、好的！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘉辛塔，如果不晕车，麻烦帮我观察我们身后的情况！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这种生死攸关的场合谁要晕车啊！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我要加速了——", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，我听见有什么在车窗外......", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"maskid": "ui_cutin_mask_vertical", "size": "590,760", "style": 0.0, "offset": "0,0", "channel": 1.0, "tsfrom": "1,1", "tsto": "1,1", "tsduration": 0.5}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 1.0, "type": 2.0, "name": "bg_desert_1", "aduration": 1.0, "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 0.0, "sfrom": "1.2,1.2", "sto": "1.2,1.2,", "pfrom": "0,-70", "pto": "0,-70"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 1.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2349_1#1$5", "aduration": 1.0, "sfrom": "0.7,0.7", "sto": "0.7,0.7", "sduration": 0.0}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 1.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "pfrom": "200,100", "pto": "50,140", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 1.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2349_1#1$5", "pfrom": "50,140", "pto": "50,140", "duration": 0.0, "aduration": 1.0, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 1.0, "clear": "true"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是一撮毛......不对，是有袋鼷兽？！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它怎么在跟着我们，难道我们之前真的遇见过它——不，难道我们一路遇见的都是它？", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它为什么在这个当口现身？！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这、这、这种时候还要偷我想说的话吗？！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......", "name": "嘉辛塔＆阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁，有袋鼷兽飞得好像很吃力的样子......而且好像也在往南飞！怎么办？", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不管怎么说，趁活性源石浓度还没太高，得让它进车里来！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其余三个人纷纷点头。"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_carwindow", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁莉娜一手稳住方向，一手摇下车窗，和风暴中挣扎的小小生物对了一个眼神。"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rodentsqueak_normal", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "叽......？", "name": "有袋鼷兽"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "进来吧，小家伙！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rodentsqueak_excited", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "叽叽！", "name": "有袋鼷兽"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.15, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "和小生物进入车厢几乎同时，安洁莉娜关紧车窗，两手紧紧握住方向盘。施术单元在她身侧微微发光。"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "辛苦你了，一撮毛......", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸？它叫一撮毛吗？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可你看它头上那一撮毛，真的很显眼......安洁，你觉得呢？", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有袋鼷兽头顶的绒毛不是被那个勇敢的雷姆必拓人打了一下之后长出来的吗？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，你说那个故事？", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果真是这样，所有的有袋鼷兽头顶应该都有毛，管它叫一撮毛和给驮兽起名叫大眼睛也没什么区别了吧。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......我不管！它就叫一撮毛好不好！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你非要坚持，那也不是不行......", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......因为这次我们真的要加速了！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "xstrength": 2.0, "ystrength": 2.0, "vibrato": 50.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "false", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_carspeedup", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_sand_transition", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_light", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "name": "塔妮&嘉辛塔&阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rodentsqueak_excited", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rodentsqueak_excited", "volume": 1.0, "channel": "2", "delay": 0.3}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "叽叽叽叽叽叽叽？！", "name": "一撮毛"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 1.0, "g": 1.0, "b": 1.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_sand02", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咳、咳！安洁，外面已经什么都看不清了......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放飞的“小飞虫”已经全部失联......需要我再放一批吗？", "name": "阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮，你那边呢，有没有听见什么不一样的声音？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "听不见！风沙声太响了，其他的我什么都——", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......？", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我在听......是不一样的声音，是......", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_carskid", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "车打滑了？！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是水！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "水？！", "name": "嘉辛塔＆阿梅利亚"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的，是水，车轮正在打滑！路面突然变得光滑了！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.25}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "风沙声停了！是、是——！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮组织语言的当口，车子终于穿破了最后的阻隔。此前从未想象过的景色在她们眼前延伸开来。"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "车里的四个人好一会儿说不出话。"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "直到有袋鼷兽兴奋地叫起来，安洁莉娜才如梦初醒，缓缓将车停下，打开车门。"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g12_skymirror", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_sunlight_l", "layer": 1.0, "y": 200.0}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$skydome2_intro", "key": "$skydome2_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看着眼前的景象，她陷入短暂的失语之中。"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在原地站了好一会儿之后，她选择张开双臂，迎接纯净的风。"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这就是......南境......？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$2"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雨季过后澄澈的天空，地面镜子一样的积水，晶体中间探出头的小花......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$2"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "和奶奶说的一模一样！所以我真的到了，这里就是......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$2"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_shallowsrun", "loop": "true", "channel": "c"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "c", "fadetime": 0.2}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮下意识地用脚轻拍地面，不是因为急躁，而是不知该如何抒发胸中的思绪。"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "轻盈的水花在她脚下绽开，打湿了她的鞋尖。潮湿的凉意让她打了个激灵。"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她忽然猛地一跺脚。"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "塔妮", "content": "奶奶——"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "塔妮", "content": "我们到南境来了——"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡特斯逆着风，但她分明觉得自己的声音传了很远很远——"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们到了——", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#21$1"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们终于到了——", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#21$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "刚刚还神经紧绷，此刻的呼喊让沃尔珀略微觉得有些缺氧。"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她知道自己正在眩晕，双脚也站不稳，但此时她宁愿相信，这是大地正在邀她跳一支轻巧的舞。"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#21$1"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "0,-30", "duration": 0.3}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 5.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 5.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_animalswaterfsfast", "loop": "true", "channel": "c"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "c", "fadetime": 0.3}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "于是她连着转了几个圈，放任眩晕让自己失去重心，一跤坐倒在水中。"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼啊......", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#21$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她看向嘉辛塔和阿梅利亚，两人也被眼前的景象震撼，久久不能说出话来。"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "duration": 1.0, "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "duration": 1.0, "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我......我没想过这里居然是这样......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "和我去过的任何地方都不一样，像一面映照着天空的镜子......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿梅，我——", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿梅利亚的脸因兴奋而涨得通红。"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "听见嘉辛塔的话，阿梅利亚把头转向她的方向，和她对上眼神。"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好了好了，阿梅利亚，你不是还有设备想在南境测试吗？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 225, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我自己的设备随时都能测试，倒是没什么关系，但根据“小飞虫”的探测，南境现在并没有信号源......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 227, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的意思是说，罗德岛的设备也坏掉了？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "按说这种设备在远程通讯系统修好后就该自动连接上的，就算连不上，也应该隔一段时间就重连一次，不该连信号都没有。", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在还没连上，说明设备本身可能也在断连时出了问题......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对哦！这里明明就没有通讯塔，为什么罗德岛的设备能连上远程通讯系统？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 235, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "罗德岛的设备上应该有一个专门的大功率发射装置，单向把数据传输到大铁屯的通讯塔——", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 237, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我在纵贯的时候不负责客制化设备的维护——说不定连客制化设备都不是，是罗德岛自己开发的设备......我没信心修好啊！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 239, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——没关系！我可以直接把存储数据的硬盘带回大涌泉镇解密的。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，我光顾着高兴了......南境就是旅途的尽头了呀！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 243, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......所以？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以这种水平如镜的地方......不是一眼就看出有没有怀表了吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 247, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "几人纷纷四处张望，几乎没有起伏的地面上空无一物。"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 0.7, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "65_g9_warmrabbitnest", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$saferoom_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "茴香......烤防风根？防风根是什么？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是格林梅多自治州盛产的蔬菜，和胡萝卜长得很像，但味道完全不同。", "name": "伊娜拉"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大涌泉镇有卖吗？有的话我买回来，明天让妈妈做？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，不用啦，我的小珊比。奶奶喝点胡萝卜汤就足够了。", "name": "伊娜拉"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "我十六岁时，手臂上刚刚冒出源石结晶。恰好也在那个时候，奶奶的食量越来越小。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "尽管奶奶在大涌泉镇算是当之无愧的高寿，这两件事仍然为当时的家里蒙上了一层阴影。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "奶奶显然意识到了这些。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "父亲当时迁怒于镇子上的感染者温泉疗养生意，被她训了一顿；母亲病急乱投医差点被骗，也是奶奶稳住了她。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "而对随着年纪增长，心事越来越多，过了十六岁却仍然被困在大涌泉镇的我，她重又把最多的时间花在了我身上。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "她会像我幼时记忆中的她一样，花上几个小时，慢慢跟我讲旅途中的见闻和趣事。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "但离家的渴盼，却总让我有意无意把话题偏转到一些特定的事情上。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奶奶，所以你的怀表有没有可能其实丢在格林梅多？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "去格林梅多时，奶奶脸上的皱纹还没有去南境时一半多呢。", "name": "伊娜拉"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔......可南境好远啊。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "想要变得像奶奶这么厉害，不跑一趟南境真的不行吗......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$1"}, {"id": 284, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不对不对，奶奶，你是不是说过，怀表不一定是丢在南境了，也可能是落在零号公路上的什么地方了？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$1"}, {"id": 286, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......", "name": "伊娜拉"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是呀。", "name": "伊娜拉"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "现在想来，她那时的微笑看起来有些复杂，她也许是想告诉我什么的。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "也许怀表只是坏了所以被丢掉了，也许怀表在奶奶走投无路时被拿去换了能救命的物资，也许怀表被送给了帮助过奶奶的人，也许......", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......也许我就算拿到怀表，也成不了像奶奶一样的源石技艺大师？", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她只是为了不让我失望，所以才一直跟我说......怀表一定躺在从大涌泉镇到南境中间的某个地方，等着我去发现？", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.2, "fillto": 0.2, "fadetime": 0.1}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.2, "fillto": 0.2, "fadetime": 0.1}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 0.0, "type": "bg", "from": 1.0, "to": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g13_worldend", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.2, "yScale": 1.2, "x": 70.0}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "BackgroundTween", "attributes": {"xFrom": 70.0, "duration": 15.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 2.0, "type": "bg", "from": 1.0, "to": 0.0}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$skydome_intro", "key": "$skydome_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁、嘉辛塔、阿梅，快看，这里是......", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是海！是大海！", "name": "塔妮"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "海......？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "南境的尽头......是海？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.25}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g13_worldend", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她在地上摊开雷姆必拓地图，这才发现，这里并非南境的尽头，但自己的确已经来到了雷姆必拓东南巨大的峡湾面前。"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "结晶不再平坦，变得崎岖不平。落差中间显示出令人目眩的精细纹理，直到结晶在海的开端处断裂，成为陡峭的崖壁。"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "更远处，阳光倾泻在冷色调的海面上，宣告着大地已至尽头，为视野中的一切镀上一层不真实的光晕。"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "正是风平浪静的时刻，和缓的浪花轻抚崖壁，浪声宛如每个人梦中都曾听过的轻柔呼唤。"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......奶奶从来没说过南境还有这样的地方。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2"}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别气馁，也许她只是忘记告诉你了——", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，我不是那个意思。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 339, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮用手搭在眼前，望着被海雾蒙上一层面纱的太阳。"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#3$2"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是现在，只是此时此地，我忽然觉得......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#3$2"}, {"id": 343, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#18$2"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......就算找不到怀表，这里仍然很美，我仍然走过了一趟很好很好的旅程。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#18$2"}, {"id": 345, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 347, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_strongwind"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好冷！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1"}, {"id": 353, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "确实好冷！好想长出一撮毛那样厚厚的毛啊......它还好吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 355, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "应该是刚刚在沙暴中用尽了力气，又在车里受了惊吓，一直都在我肩上睡觉。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我刚刚还怕倒在水里的时候把它浸湿呢，看来是没关系......", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 358, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......嗯？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1"}, {"id": 360, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎么了？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2"}, {"id": 362, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看崖壁边上......是不是有个小东西正在发亮？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#4$1"}, {"id": 364, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......真的！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}, {"id": 367, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "崖壁边上，不知什么东西正在阳光的照射下闪闪发光。"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难道......难道奶奶真的把她的怀表......丢在了这里？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}, {"id": 371, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "BackgroundTween", "attributes": {"xFrom": 0.0, "xTo": 40.0, "duration": 4.0, "block": "false", "xScaleFrom": 1.0, "yScaleFrom": 1.0, "xScaleTo": 1.1, "yScaleTo": 1.1}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮如同在梦中一般，摇摇晃晃地朝着崖边那点剔透的反光走去。"}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁莉娜想叫住她，但那毕竟是塔妮一路以来的愿望，所以安洁莉娜只是小心翼翼地跟在塔妮身后。"}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$2"}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好漂亮的闪光......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$2"}, {"id": 380, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那点晶莹的光就在那里一动不动，仿佛正等待着塔妮前来唤醒一般。"}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2"}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2"}, {"id": 385, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不对，不是怀表，是......有袋鼷兽的眼睛？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2"}, {"id": 387, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2348_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$farce_n_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还有更多——这里有好多有袋鼷兽！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}, {"id": 394, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "毛茸茸的......好可爱......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 396, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "岩壁后、礁石下、结晶旁......四人此前并未注意到的地方，有袋鼷兽纷纷露出身形。"}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它们的袋中有的装着野果，有的装着花草，也有一些装着亮晶晶的小物件，仿佛真的要将这些送至某处一般。"}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它们是来欢迎我们的？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 401, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "仔细想想，它们迎接的应该是一撮毛吧。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 403, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果进大涌泉镇之前是一撮毛弄松了我绑的行李，那它也赶了很远的路，才回到了家呀。", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 404, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一撮毛，我们回家了呢——嗯？", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 405, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rodentsqueak_scared"}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2349_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（畏惧的嘶嘶声）", "name": "一撮毛"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2349_1#2$1"}, {"id": 408, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-50,0", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 412, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不知为何，一撮毛看起来并不放松，反而畏缩起来，直往安洁莉娜的背后躲。"}}, {"id": 416, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 417, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "与此同时，毛茸茸的生物们也朝着四人的方向飞了过来——"}}, {"id": 418, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 419, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 420, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rodentsqueak_normal"}}, {"id": 421, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rodentsqueak_normal", "channel": "2", "delay": 0.5}}, {"id": 422, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rodentsqueak_normal", "channel": "3", "delay": 1.0}}, {"id": 423, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rodentsqueak_normal", "channel": "4", "delay": 1.1}}, {"id": 424, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "action": "zoom", "poszoom": "0.5,0.5", "scale": 0.8, "duration": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 425, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2349_1#1$6", "duration": 0.3, "bstart": 0.5, "bend": 0.8}}, {"id": 426, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "action": "zoom", "poszoom": "0.5,0.5", "scale": 1.0, "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 427, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "-150,200", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 428, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 15.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 429, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 430, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.3}}, {"id": 431, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "action": "zoom", "poszoom": "0.5,0.5", "scale": 0.8, "duration": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 432, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2349_1#1$5", "duration": 0.3, "bstart": 0.5, "bend": 0.8}}, {"id": 433, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {